H('391.d.1.D',3,"In a car, the engine, transmission, and brakes work together so the vehicle can travel safely. This shows that subsystems:","interact to achieve a common goal",["operate with no connection","compete for power","work separately"],"Subsystems depend on each other to meet the system's goal.")
