H('391.d.1.G',4,"After testing a prototype, the design team finds a flaw. The process then calls for them to:","redesign and improve",["ignore the flaw","stop the project","skip testing"],"Design is iterative: test, find flaws, improve.")

H('391.d.2.A',3,"In a technical report, the best writing style is:","clear and concise",["long and vague","slang-filled","humorous"],"Technical writing must be easy to understand.")
